tools.description:
GET /accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/session/{session_id}

Get session details.

Get details for a specific browser session.

DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}/profiles/{profile_name}/sessions/{session_id}

Delete a session

Marks all memories and messages in a profile that are tagged with the given session ID for deletion.

DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}

Close browser session.

Closes an existing browser session.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/realtime/kit/{app_id}/livestreams/sessions/{livestream-session-id}

Fetch livestream session details using livestream session ID

Returns livestream session details for the given livestream session ID. Retrieve the `livestream_session_id`using the `Fetch livestream session details using a session ID` API.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/realtime/kit/{app_id}/sessions/{session_id}

Fetch details of a session

Returns data of the given session ID including recording details.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/email/sending/messages/{message_id}

Fetch an email message

Returns the raw RFC 5322 MIME message for the given account and message id.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}/json/close/{target_id}

Close a browser target.

Closes a specific browser target (tab, page, etc.) by its ID. Returns 'Target is closing' on success or an error if the target is not found.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/session/{session_id}

Get session details.

Get details for a specific browser session.

DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}/profiles/{profile_name}/sessions/{session_id}

Delete a session

Marks all memories and messages in a profile that are tagged with the given session ID for deletion.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/realtime/kit/{app_id}/livestreams/sessions/{livestream-session-id}

Fetch livestream session details using livestream session ID

Returns livestream session details for the given livestream session ID. Retrieve the `livestream_session_id`using the `Fetch livestream session details using a session ID` API.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/realtime/kit/{app_id}/sessions/{session_id}

Fetch details of a session

Returns data of the given session ID including recording details.

DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}

Close browser session.

Closes an existing browser session.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/recording/{session_id}

Get recording data.

Returns the recording data for a given session as a dictionary of events per targetId.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/email/sending/messages/{message_id}

Fetch an email message

Returns the raw RFC 5322 MIME message for the given account and message id.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/realtime/kit/{app_id}/sessions/{session_id}/participants/{participant_id}

Fetch details of a participant

Returns details of the given participant ID for the given session ID. Use the peer report endpoint to retrieve call statistics.

PATCH /user/load_balancers/monitors/{monitor_id}

Patch Monitor

Apply changes to an existing monitor, overwriting the supplied properties.

PATCH /user/load_balancers/pools/{pool_id}

Patch Pool

Apply changes to an existing pool, overwriting the supplied properties.

GET /user/load_balancers/monitors/{monitor_id}

Monitor Details

Fetch a single configured monitor for a user.

PATCH /accounts/{account_id}/load_balancers/monitor_groups/{monitor_group_id}

Patch Monitor Group

Apply changes to an existing monitor group, overwriting the supplied properties.

PATCH /accounts/{account_id}/load_balancers/monitors/{monitor_id}

Patch Monitor

Apply changes to an existing monitor, overwriting the supplied properties.

PUT /user/load_balancers/monitors/{monitor_id}

Update Monitor

Modify a configured monitor.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/connectivity/directory/services/{service_id}

Get Workers VPC connectivity service

Fetches a single Workers VPC connectivity service by its ID.

PUT /accounts/{account_id}/connectivity/directory/services/{service_id}

Update Workers VPC connectivity service

Updates an existing Workers VPC connectivity service by its ID.

GET /radar/post_quantum/origin/summary/{dimension}

Get Origin Post-Quantum Data Summary

Returns a summary of origin post-quantum data grouped by the specified dimension.

DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/workers/observability/issues/groups/{groupId}/members/{issueId}

Remove an issue group member

Remove an issue from a group, dissolving the group when fewer than two members remain.

POST /accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/requests/{project_type}

Creates a new RFI

Creates a new Request for Information with the specified project type and details.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}

Get a Cloudflare Pages project

Retrieve the configuration and deployment settings for a Cloudflare Pages project.

PATCH /accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}

Update a Cloudflare Pages project

Update the build, deployment, source, or environment settings for a Cloudflare Pages project. To delete an environment variable, set its key to `null`.

PATCH /zones/{zone_id}/api_gateway/user_schemas/{schema_id}

Enable validation for a schema

Activates schema validation for an uploaded OpenAPI schema. Requests to matching endpoints will be validated against the schema definitions. Deprecated; use `/zones/{zone_id}/schema_validation/schemas/{schema_id}` instead.

GET /zones/{zone_id}/api_gateway/user_schemas/{schema_id}

Retrieve information about a specific schema on a zone

Gets detailed information about a specific uploaded OpenAPI schema, including its contents and validation configuration. Deprecated; use `/zones/{zone_id}/schema_validation/schemas/{schema_id}` instead.

DELETE /zones/{zone_id}/api_gateway/user_schemas/{schema_id}

Delete a schema

Permanently removes an uploaded OpenAPI schema from API Shield schema validation. Operations using this schema will lose their validation rules. Deprecated; use `/zones/{zone_id}/schema_validation/schemas/{schema_id}` instead.

DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/calls/turn_keys/{key_id}

Delete TURN key

Deletes a Realtime TURN key.

GET /accounts/{account_id}/calls/turn_keys/{key_id}

Retrieve TURN key details

Fetches details for a single TURN key.

PUT /accounts/{account_id}/calls/turn_keys/{key_id}

Update TURN key details

Updates details for a single TURN key.

DELETE /zones/{zone_id}/waiting_rooms/{waiting_room_id}

Delete waiting room

Deletes a waiting room.

GET /zones/{zone_id}/waiting_rooms/{waiting_room_id}

Waiting room details

Fetches a single configured waiting room.

PATCH /zones/{zone_id}/waiting_rooms/{waiting_room_id}

Patch waiting room

Patches a configured waiting room.

PATCH /user/load_balancers/monitors/{monitor_id}

Patch Monitor

Apply changes to an existing monitor, overwriting the supplied properties.

GET /radar/http/top/ases/browser_family/{browser_family}

Get top ASes by HTTP requests for a browser family

Retrieves the top autonomous systems, by HTTP requests, of the requested browser family.

GET /radar/http/top/locations/browser_family/{browser_family}

Get top locations by HTTP requests for a browser family

Retrieves the top locations, by HTTP requests, of the requested browser family.
